---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'China Visa Types Complete Guide 2026: Which Visa Do คุณต้องขอวีซ่า depends on your passport.</strong> Citizens of 50 countries can enter visa-free สูงสุด 30 วัน, and another 29 have mutual visa-free agreements. Travelers from 55 countries can use the 240-hour transit policy. Everyone else needs a standard L-type Tourist Visa.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 In This Guide</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#need-visa" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛂 Do คุณต้องขอวีซ่า stamp in your passport at all. You just show your passport to immigration and they let you in. It's completely different from having a visa — it's the absence of one.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Do I need to register with police after entering visa-free?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">If you're staying at a hotel, they'll handle the registration automatically. If you're staying at a private residence, your host needs to register you at the local police station within 24 hours. This applies regardless of how you entered China.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">What if I have dual citizenship?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">China doesn't recognize dual nationality. Use the passport you intend to enter China with. If one of your passports is from a visa-free country, use that one — it simplifies everything.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Before applying for a visa, check whether you qualify for visa-free entry or the 240-hour transit policy. If not, a standard L-type Tourist Visa remains the most common route for visitors.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📚 Sources</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://en.nia.gov.cn/n147418/n147463/c183390/content.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">National Immigration Administration — List of Countries Covered by Unilateral Visa Exemption</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://en.nia.gov.cn/n147418/n147463/c183412/content.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">National Immigration Administration — Visa-Free Transit Policies</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.visaforchina.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">China Visa Application Service Center</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- คู่มือที่เกี่ยวข้อง -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 คู่มือที่เกี่ยวข้อง</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/th/visa/visa-free/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">รายชื่อประเทศที่ได้รับการยกเว้นวีซ่าจีน (2026)</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">See if your passport qualifies</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/th/visa/transit-240/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Explained</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">10-day transit without a visa</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/th/visa/mutual-agreement/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">ข้อตกลงยกเว้นวีซ่าร่วมกัน (29 Countries)</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Which countries have bilateral deals</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/th/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">How to Apply for China Tourist Visa (L-Type)</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Step-by-step application guide</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/th/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">วิธีชำระเงินในจีน</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Alipay, WeChat Pay, and cash</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>